<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CSOB cuts prime rate to 23 pct from 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech CSOB cuts prime rate to 23 pct from 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Ceskoslovenska Obchodni Banka a.s. (CSOB) said it cut its prime lending rate on Monday to 23 percent from 25 percent.</p>
<p>CSOB said in a statement that its base rate for one to two-year credit was cut to 21 percent from 23 percent, and the base interest rate for maturities longer than two years was cut to 19 percent from 21 percent.</p>
</text>
